":"Q02252","text":"Malonate and methylmalonate semialdehyde dehydrogenase involved in the catabolism of valine, thymine, and compounds catabolized by way of beta-alanine, including uracil and cytidine."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}